    "title": "Temperatures are heating up for the end of the week - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Chelsea Simmons ,\n4 hours ago We have some great weather to look forward to toward the end of this week, with both daytime highs and overnight lows warming up significantly over the next few days. This is a welcome change compared to the colder temperatures we experienced earlier this week. We anticipate morning temperatures in the 40s and 50s, with afternoon highs climbing into the 70s and potentially reaching the low 80s at times. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
